xt\"></span></span> school subjects.</p><p>The Fordham library includes resources for teaching in <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">24</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c6-t4-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> education and special needs.</p><p>Current issues of periodicals are available at both libraries, although <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">25</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c6-t4-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> issues are only available at Fordham.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":5},{"id":"en-c6-t4-l-g3-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 26-27","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>Answer the questions below.</p><p>Write NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.</p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">26</strong><span>Which books cannot be renewed by telephone or email?</span></span><span data-luma-question=\"en-c6-t4-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">27</strong><span>How much time is allowed to return recalled books?</span></span><span data-luma-question=\"en-c6-t4-l-q27\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":2},{"id":"en-c6-t4-l-g3-2","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"matching_features","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 28-30","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>Choose THREE letters, A-G.</p></div><div class=\"source-quest